  "title": "Week 39: Light Show ✨ @Kadriorg",
  "date": "2025-09-19T21:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "Week 39: Light Show ✨ @Kadriorg\n\nEvery year, Kadriorg Park hosts a special light show 🌌.\n\nThis time, I went straight after class at TLU. At 8 p.m., the tram was sooo packed 🚋🙅, so I just walked — luckily it’s only 1km away.\n\nTram\n\nArriving at Kadriorg, the first thing I saw was this glowing entrance 🌟\n\n\n\n\n\nWalking into the forest felt surreal — so dreamy 🌲💫.\nThough, my phone camera kinda made it look like a horror movie 👀😂\n\n\n\nI actually missed the first light show around the lake 😅 Too many people squeezed in.\n\n\n\nThankfully, the show replays every 40 minutes ⏳. So I just chilled on the grass 🍃, waited… and slowly lost all feeling in my legs 🪑➡️🦵💤\n\n\n\n\n\nOn the way back to dorm, I saw this hot dog vendor. Finaly see some street food at night.\n\n\n\nHere’s a short clip 🎥 from the magical night ✨👇",
